<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Thursday it</p>
<p>qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues</p>
<p>scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Pottsville School District No 61, Ark., $2.085 million contruction bonds.</p>
<p>--Whittemore-Prescott, Mich., $10.2 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Suffolk County, N.Y., $72.49 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Bilma Public Utility District, Texas, $1.5 million unlimited tax bonds.</p>
<p>--Conroe, Texas, $3.5 million certificates of obligation.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
